# Route: guide 24 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 43 to 45, 41
# quests, 4.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dustwallow Marsh, Swamp of Sorrows, Desolace): Theramore Isle -> Witch
# Hill -> Theramore Isle -> Witch Hill -> Brackenwall Village -> The Den of
# Flame -> Witch Hill -> Theramore Isle -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill
# -> Brackenwall Village -> Splinterspear Junction -> Itharius's Cave -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# Shadowshard Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher
# 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Khan Hratha (1380; Khan Hratha 42).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Tiara of the Deep (2846), Legends of Maraudon (7044), The
# Pariah's Instructions (7067).

